  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "我m̄是tshenn-mê牛--ah  "
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b>作者：張維庭</b><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">（作者是「基進會輾轉台語讀寫基礎班」結業學員）</span><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n開始學台語文tsiah無三個月niā-niā，tsit-má我已經ē-sái看有台語文，mā ē-sái寫--ah。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n差不多一冬前，我看一本白色恐怖受難前輩寫ê冊tsiah知影台語其實有文字，hit-tang-tsūn我ê心內是tsiok激動--ê。因為gún兜lóng是講台語--ê，但是我從來m̄知影台語有文字。自細漢我ê爸母lóng kap我講台語，m̄-koh我lóng回in華語，罕leh講台語，kan-na kap阿公阿媽講話ē用--著，因為in bē-hiáu華語。Tsit-má想--起-來我mā是去hōo國民黨ê華語政策影響，規个社會ê氣氛對台語tsiok無友善，造成我無想beh講台語。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTsit幾年我開始去了解台灣ê歷史，愈了解以前ê代誌，愈感覺ài kā lán ê語言kap文化揣--tńg-來。多謝老師hōo我有tsit个機會學習台語文，我m̄是台語ê tshenn-mê牛--ah！Mā ǹg望台語ē-tàng繼續傳承--落-去。&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"background-color: white;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>#心內話</b></span></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>專欄，</b></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案</b></span><b style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\">。</b></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報308期，2019年11月出刊。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n--------------------------------------------</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
